  "description": "QIQTAO crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H108 N18 Nd4 O42 Zn3,6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Nd1 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 2 pairs, 5 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.642-3.642 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.01-98.07°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Zn3Nd4C114H126N24O42.",
